              "currentTitleDe": "Halbtitration zur pK-Bestimmung nutzen",
              "currentTitleEn": "Use half-titration to determine pK values",
              "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann das Prinzip der Halbtitration erläutern und pKS- bzw. pKB-Werte unbekannter Säuren oder Basen aus Halbtitrationsdaten bestimmen.",
              "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can explain the principle of half-titration and determine pKa or pKb values of unknown acids or bases from half-titration data.",
              "decision": "keep",
              "understandingEvidence": {
                "essentialUnderstandingDe": "Am stöchiometrischen Halbäquivalenzpunkt eines geeigneten schwachen konjugierten Paares führt das Mengenverhältnis eins über das MWG zu pH≈pKa oder pOH≈pKb.",
                "essentialUnderstandingEn": "At the stoichiometric half-equivalence point of a suitable weak conjugate pair, the amount ratio of one yields pH≈pKa or pOH≈pKb through mass action.",
                "observablePerformanceDe": "Die lernende Person findet aus Stoffmengen und Äquivalenzvolumen den Halbpunkt, begründet das Verhältnis der Pufferpartner und bestimmt aus den bereitgestellten Daten den passenden pKa- oder pKb-Wert.",
                "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner identifies the half point from amounts and equivalence volume, justifies the buffer-species ratio and determines the appropriate pKa or pKb from supplied data.",
                "transferExpectationDe": "Beim Wechsel von einer schwachen Säure zu einer schwachen Base oder einem ungeeigneten starken System begründet sie die passende pH/pOH-Umrechnung beziehungsweise das Scheitern des Halbpunktarguments.",
                "transferExpectationEn": "On changing from a weak acid to a weak base or an unsuitable strong system, the learner explains the appropriate pH/pOH conversion or the failure of half-point reasoning."
              },
              "rationale": "One half-titration inferencemethod: amountbalance identifies the half-equivalencepoint and the equilibriumratio givespKa orpKb. Acid/baseversions require theappropriatepH/pOHconversion. Quarternvolume, full equivalence, pHmidpoint and strongHCl counterexamples test the methodconditions. The dataarchetype fits interpretationofsupplieddata; no actualtitrationexecution isclaimed or requiredbythisdescription. Actual seven current native PDF/HTML/model contexts, all14 full bilingual cases and56rubric criteria and7whole rawprofile bodies were independently reviewed before FIRST. Rawprofile design is separately scientifically accepted as an AI candidate; current native evidenceProfile is null, hence create. No current peer outcomes read; prior own Source4/NAT9/D2/D5 roles and permitted historical Vmetadata are disclosed. Source/course/acquisition holds remain; no learner execution, human approval, M7 or active integration claim.",
